### =============================================
### 测试接口集合
### Controller: TestController.java
### 描述: 提供DatabaseUtil和数据查询功能的测试接口
### =============================================
###
### 使用前准备:
### 1. 确保服务运行在 http://localhost:9931/libra-toolkit
### 2. 确保数据库已初始化（执行 sql/init-database.sql）
### 3. 确保数据库连接配置正确（application-dev.yml）
### =============================================

### 环境变量配置
@baseUrl = http://localhost:9931/libra-toolkit
@contentType = application/json

### =============================================
### 1. 基础健康检查 - GET请求
### @GetMapping("/test/demo1")
### =============================================
# 测试服务是否正常运行
# 预期返回: "测试成功！"
GET {{baseUrl}}/test/demo1

### 响应示例
#{
#  "success": true,
#  "message": "",
#  "code": 0,
#  "result": "测试成功！",
#  "timestamp": 1699437000000
#}

### =============================================
### 2. POST请求参数测试 - 接收JSON参数
### @PostMapping("/test/demo2")
### =============================================
# 测试POST请求和JSON参数接收
# 参数会被原样返回（JSON字符串格式）
POST {{baseUrl}}/test/demo2
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "张三",
  "age": 25,
  "department": "研发部",
  "skills": ["Java", "Spring Boot", "MySQL"]
}

### 响应示例
#{
#  "success": true,
#  "message": "",
#  "code": 0,
#  "result": "{\"name\":\"张三\",\"age\":25,\"department\":\"研发部\",\"skills\":[\"Java\",\"Spring Boot\",\"MySQL\"]}",
#  "timestamp": 1699437000000
#}

### =============================================
### 3. POST请求 - 空对象测试
### @PostMapping("/test/demo2")
### =============================================
# 测试发送空对象
POST {{baseUrl}}/test/demo2
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}

### 响应示例
#{
#  "success": true,
#  "message": "",
#  "code": 0,
#  "result": "{}",
#  "timestamp": 1699437000000
#}

